from sys-hall-of-fame.replay
# sys-hof-pc (docs/research/hall-of-fame-credits.md §3): after the clear, a Pokémon Center PC offers
# HALL OF FAME (FLAG_GAME_COMPLETED). The viewer opens on the newest entry's first member; A shows its moves and
# back, Down the next member, Right wraps to the same (only) entry; B closes it (6-frame fades) and the script
# returns to the PC's menu. Read only: the history is unchanged.
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY_POKECENTER_1F 12 4 up
until idle
+1 press a
+1 release a
advance text
# SOMEONE'S PC, <player>'S PC, PROF. ROWAN'S PC, HALL OF FAME, SWITCH OFF
+5 press down
+1 release down
+1 press down
+1 release down
+1 press down
+1 release down
+1 press a
+1 release a
until app hall-of-fame 600
+10 screenshot hof-pc
+0 press a
+1 release a
+1 screenshot hof-pc-moves
+0 press a
+1 release a
+1 press down
+1 release down
+1 press right
+1 release right
+1 press b
+1 release b
until app none 60
+0 assert state hallOfFame.total 1
+0 assert state hallOfFame.entries.length 1
until menu 600
+5 press b
+1 release b
advance text
until idle 600
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY_POKECENTER_1F 12 4
